{
  "$schema": "./montage_display.schema.json",
  "name": "neonatal",
  "description": "Modified 10-20 neonatal montage based on Shellhaas (2011) ACNS guideline 13, plus an occipital traversal (T3-O1 -> O1-O2 -> O2-T4). 16 channels arranged as paired temporal then paired central long chains, followed by a coronal row, midline, and a back occipital traversal. Spacers fall at each left/right transition.",
